   "titulo": "Ask the price and size",
   "texto": [
    "Hvor mye koster denne genseren? means «How much is this sweater?». Koster doesn't change with the person. To ask for the size: Hvilken størrelse vil du ha?",
    "The currency of Norway is the Norwegian crown, krone; in plural, krone. It is not the crown as an object: the price context points to the currency. In a price it is said, for example, tre hundre kroner («trescientas coronas»)."
